// Woodland Glade: a clearing in the trees with no gate and no lever, only the old stumps and
// boulders. The beacon stands in a ring of stones, a plus of five tiles, open on every side, and
// the stumps cut the glade into lanes that meet at it.
// The four old trees by the glade's lanes shed acorns on whoever stands round them when shaken:
// a contest shakes one, and every fourth turn a breeze shakes a pair across from each other.
id: woodland
name: Woodland Glade
event: soak
event_name: tree
event_tiles: around
event_first: 4
event_every: 4
switch_rest: 2
